                        "language": "english",
                        "review": " honestly, I don’t know what I was supposed to enjoy about this game. The gameplay feels clunky, the pacing is painfully slow, and the whole experience gets boring way faster than it should. I kept waiting for things to get interesting, but it mostly felt like I was forcing myself to keep playing. The atmosphere has potential, but it doesn’t make up for the frustrating mechanics and lack of anything that really kept me invested. It feels like a game that wants to be creepy without actually being particularly scary. \nMaybe some people will enjoy it, but for me, this was less “sense of the devil” and more “sense of regret after buying it.” Definitely not something I’d recommend.",
